  <item>
    <title>又一次“好久不见”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab8dc9fe742e36efcbbb6f7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab8dc9fe742e36efcbbb6f7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 09:09:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi there, 我又回来啦</span></p><p><span>这是一期来自kk的单人录制</span></p><p><span>停更的这段时间，我和盆仔的人生都在经历非常多的变化。从学校踏进社会的那一瞬间，像是世界在这个节点才把你识别为“成年人”，然后迫不及待的把所有人生课题一股脑的塞给你，期待你立马给出答案。“社会”再也不是隔着象牙塔被观测的客体，而是切身实地的生活背景。当柴米油盐的琐碎问题成为每天需要思考的问题，人也会逐渐失去讨论宏大议题的动力。</span></p><p><span>本期是kk最近的一些零碎想法，第一次尝试独播的形式，希望你会喜欢~</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsB4ynCU_15LvmCreCCf2rS6U1UB.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FosCurYTlCNDPBhnrk3-5-v8HV3G.png"><blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 关于停更</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> kk和盆仔的近况</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a> 最近的一些想法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a> 时间无情流逝，健康问题接踵而至</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">12:31</a> 关于请假的心理负担</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="921">15:21</a> 对于专注自身的课题，我选择了信息屏蔽</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1128">18:48</a> 迷茫是比焦虑更难处理的情绪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 建设稳定感的思路</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a> 关于探索世界和个人爱好</span></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>BGM:&nbsp;TABLO; 方艺潭 - anime (feat. 방예담)</span></strong></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6389e378397f5e87ebc3d0ef/lhgpKMDrRue5QhFjY83SbVLUbAhI.m4a" length="26506514" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:27:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fke84T7YS4xp4XYTtYcsJm4152rA.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>长大是种什么体验？今天的你“活”了吗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c40be2bf52a16cd1f343e2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c40be2bf52a16cd1f343e2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Mar 2025 07:52:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi there, 好久不见~</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一起来自24年10月的录制，kk、盆仔和阿清从近况开始进行了无主题漫谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>成长的快乐仿佛是一种“薛定谔的快乐”，开心，但不完全开心。在获得自由和能力的同时，也不可避免的肩负了责任。</span></p><span></span><p><span>长大真好，长大真烦！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWLLtivZjANzkEWoGNKSPa9jg0k.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhAmlZICgEfUsvE1cu0tqJUQHjJx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsIWvMYsm5s8TxSfEsI5YMqzT_21.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh3vf9dDFKvIC7_nqgRiaOV3UQjp.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a> 近况更新</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 摆脱令人精疲力尽的工作</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a> 新入职（新生培训）的社交强度</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">12:21</a> 成年后自己旅行</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a> 建立生活的多个支点</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1284">21:24</a> 抖音偷偷偷走我们的时间</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 随着年龄变化产生的改变</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2069">34:29</a> 长大真好，长大真烦</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2762">46:02</a> 闲聊之余</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>BGM: G-DRAGON - DRAMA</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6389e378397f5e87ebc3d0ef/loMrY3MIhFApVe-88tkX3WP5pcZG.m4a" length="39643558" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:12</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhjdPl7cOun0mrygzHanWZVigzTl.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>021 由毕业季引发的闲聊（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e2a9db5ca6d0ace36d9dbb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e2a9db5ca6d0ace36d9dbb</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Sep 2024 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi there，</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期衔接上期，是闲聊的后半段。上次更新后收到了很多大家的正向反馈，我们也会在后续多采用这种无主题的闲聊形式，希望我们也像你的朋友一般，互相陪伴，走过下一个一年四季。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWLLtivZjANzkEWoGNKSPa9jg0k.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhAmlZICgEfUsvE1cu0tqJUQHjJx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FosCurYTlCNDPBhnrk3-5-v8HV3G.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a> 从象牙塔踏入残酷现实</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> 从“正确的路”到“合适的路”</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">03:58</a> 对于学设计的学生来说，大学就是天堂</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a> 不是所有遗憾都能被补全</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="501">08:21</a> 逃避造成的更大焦虑</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 模仿路径的弊端</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> 关于脚踏实地</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1236">20:36</a> 耍小聪明带来的后果</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1384">23:04</a> 关于培养爱好</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM:&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Brian Cheng - Bye Bye Monica</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sabrina Carpenter - Espresso</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsIsDNFnWGZJ0FxoIk3um8tw9n8N.m4a" length="19833915" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:27:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhJGBJ-tKtpHQBb9DaaZV-C1X0L-.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>020 由毕业季引发的一次闲聊（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c84f66ead5fc3792e94ab0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c84f66ead5fc3792e94ab0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Aug 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi there，好久不见</span></p><span></span><p><span>前段时间赶上毕业季，盆仔顺利毕业了。经历了身份转换的我们也对自己的生活有了很多新的认知和感受，就聚在一起想哪说哪的聊了聊，时长问题我们分成了上下两期发布。不同于之前有一个明确的主题，这次我们没有固定的大纲，大家当是朋友间的闲话，希望能在评论区听到你的想法~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWLLtivZjANzkEWoGNKSPa9jg0k.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhAmlZICgEfUsvE1cu0tqJUQHjJx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FosCurYTlCNDPBhnrk3-5-v8HV3G.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> 最近在忙啥</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a> 机缘巧合带来的合作</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="389">06:29</a> 文科是我的原罪</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a> 关于做教培的一些想法</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="959">15:59</a> 实力是最大的底气</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a> 持续学习是一种能力</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> 对于生活的感知力</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1563">26:03</a> 对于琐碎瞬间的记录</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>BGM: Brian Cheng - Bye Bye Monica</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lt2ePC4CsA5an3_DNkjmabm7ZtCm.m4a" length="21312694" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:29:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhJGBJ-tKtpHQBb9DaaZV-C1X0L-.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>019 当不确定性成为常态，我们要如何面对世界</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662495f2c3e09d8f376857f9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662495f2c3e09d8f376857f9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Apr 2024 04:28:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi there，</span></p><span></span><p><span>这两年总会觉得未来被大片的迷雾笼罩，预测或者规划自己的生活都变成了一件很难的事情，外界不断地变动让自己的小世界也很艰难的维系着相对的稳定。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不知道你会不会有相同的感受，这一期我们一起来聊聊。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWLLtivZjANzkEWoGNKSPa9jg0k.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhAmlZICgEfUsvE1cu0tqJUQHjJx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl_HWBBPB8Uo6hAL75nIsy2tPU3_.PNG"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a> 搬家，找工作，恋爱……不确定的事怎么那么多</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">08:34</a> 选择变多反而变得更加迷茫</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a> 后果之一是做事功利性极强</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">14:41</a> 执行力一落千丈</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1048">17:28</a> 淡人有一种平静的疯感</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1402">23:22</a> 不确定感总归还是带来了点好东西</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2003">33:23</a> 世上唯一的确定，是一切都是不确定</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a> 主动寻找可以制造确定感的事情</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2342">39:02</a> 认知并尊重自己的感受</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2441">40:41</a> 不如反向排除自己不喜欢的</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>BGM: Johnny Stimson - Pink Lemonade</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljknA7JvRCgwTBhISE77H-arG2I4.m4a" length="35202983" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:11</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z2TUdMNkZOOGMyTElhV0VqU293SkJxcXBDS2EucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>018 跟2023说拜拜 和2024说嗨嗨</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f3b1b867649570796f6275</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f3b1b867649570796f6275</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 Mar 2024 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>⭐️本期是主播们对于2023的回顾。好像自从成年以后，时间就以日益迅捷的速度飞快从身边流走，拥有的越来越多，而留下的好像却越来越少。回忆2023，有哪些让你难忘的瞬间呢，欢迎在评论区告诉我们你的珍贵回忆~</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡本期bgm是kk私心很喜欢的一首歌，截取部分歌词分享给你：</span></p><span></span><p><span>别急着抵达终点</span></p><span></span><p><span>过程才是关键</span></p><span></span><p><span>是那些琐碎细节</span></p><span></span><p><span>才最值得纪念</span></p><span></span><p><span>就让我们慢一点</span></p><span></span><p><span>光阴已经似箭 多危险</span></p><span></span><p><span>就请明天慢一点</span></p><span></span><p><span>每天度日如年 多新鲜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWLLtivZjANzkEWoGNKSPa9jg0k.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhAmlZICgEfUsvE1cu0tqJUQHjJx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsIWvMYsm5s8TxSfEsI5YMqzT_21.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh3vf9dDFKvIC7_nqgRiaOV3UQjp.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>2023 keywords</span></strong><span>🔍 ⬆️</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>盆仔：坚持 平衡 勇敢</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>kk：连接 流动 沉淀</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>阿清：失而复得 沉淀 理解</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>❤️</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 2023年什么带给了我能量</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="282">04:42</a> 2023印象最深刻的瞬间</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">12:21</a> 关于连接，坚持，和失而复得</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🔍</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1194">19:54</a> 2023钱都花在哪了（最值得的一笔消费/最亏的一笔消费）</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1506">25:06</a> 2023年的新尝试/2023年最大的改变</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a> 关于流动，沉淀，和平衡</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>⬆️</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2367">39:27</a> 2023年学到的一个道理</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2727">45:27</a> 2023年最庆幸自己做了什么/最后悔没有去做的是什么</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3125">52:05</a> 关于勇敢，理解，和沉淀</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3332">55:32</a> 2024年的期望和计划</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>BGM: 林宥嘉-慢一点</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lraWHH7ByUZmwclVjz7ntjG-r4vH.m4a" length="45563721" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZsYXVMdFlaRVBFbFl1bEhLbEhwY2tBcXhadWgucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>017 亲密关系中的自我：焦虑、回避与稳定</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e3eedf4525864db9e8aa23</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e3eedf4525864db9e8aa23</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Mar 2024 03:30:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>依恋（Attachment）的概念最早起源于对婴幼儿的研究。依恋产生于婴儿与其父母的互动过程中，是一种情感上的联结和纽带。Ainsworth通过实验发现，不同的婴幼儿和父母之间的情感互动的表现很不相同，从表现上可以分为安全型依恋和不安全型依恋。</span></p><span></span><p><span>依恋理论的创始人Bowlby认为，依恋是贯穿一生的议题，儿童的早期依恋会转化为成人的依恋类型。成人依恋是指个体与亲密同伴、恋人伴侣之间形成的能够提供亲密感和安全感的情感联系。随着个体的成长和发展，依恋会逐渐演化出不同的模式：会有和恋人之间的亲密关系依恋类型、和熟人朋友之间的一般人际依恋类型等等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（以上文字摘取自“KnowYourself”依恋类型测试介绍）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🖤本期三位主播就来根据自身聊了聊依恋类型。请注意，本期内容并非有科学依据的讲解，而是基于自身经历的猜想和探讨。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤎你的依恋人格类型是什么，又有过什么样的故事呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔍欢迎在评论区留下你的声音~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWLLtivZjANzkEWoGNKSPa9jg0k.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhAmlZICgEfUsvE1cu0tqJUQHjJx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsIWvMYsm5s8TxSfEsI5YMqzT_21.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh3vf9dDFKvIC7_nqgRiaOV3UQjp.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 四种依恋类型介绍</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a> 依恋类型和星座有关系吗</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 焦虑型依恋的产生路径</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a> 回避型依恋的一些特质</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 焦虑型依恋和回避型依恋是地狱级别的天造地设</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">26:57</a> 焦虑型依恋是很被动的</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">35:10</a> 躲避亲密，实际上是一种自我保护</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2272">37:52</a> 不同依恋类型的成长路径</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2431">40:31</a> 内核不稳又是重要成因</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2660">44:20</a> 如何培养一个安全型依恋人格？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2768">46:08</a> 原生家庭对依恋人格类型的影响</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2936">48:56</a> 哪些因素影响了我们的依恋类型</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>BGM: Ayumu Imazu - Obsessed</span></p>]]></description>
