    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🩷本❤️期🧡聊💛聊💚恋🩵爱💙脑💜</span></p><span></span><p><span>🖤恋爱脑一定是贬义词吗？为什么会陷入恋爱脑？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🩶恋爱脑drama故事大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤎摆脱恋爱脑的一些小妙招~</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔍欢迎在评论区留下你的声音~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWLLtivZjANzkEWoGNKSPa9jg0k.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhAmlZICgEfUsvE1cu0tqJUQHjJx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsIWvMYsm5s8TxSfEsI5YMqzT_21.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh3vf9dDFKvIC7_nqgRiaOV3UQjp.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> 恋爱脑是贬义词吗？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> 掰扯一下恋爱脑的定义</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 阿清身边的恋爱脑故事</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="521">08:41</a> 恋爱脑才是最真诚的？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> typical的恋爱脑行为</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>玫瑰色的逻辑闭环</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>自我牺牲 = 合理付出</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>失去自己生活</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 恋爱中的牺牲，妥协和高低位</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>恋爱脑drama故事集合</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="992">16:32</a> 我们三个一起把日子过好……</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 图他老，图他油，图他出轨无底线……</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1212">20:12</a> “就算你变成了les，最终我们还是会在一起的”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">21:01</a> 喝醉后的怨种本能</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1309">21:49</a> 为什么会反复陷入恋爱脑？</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">22:48</a> 东亚小孩对被认可的执着</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1494">24:54</a> 对自我评价体系的单一</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>如果你想摆脱恋爱脑</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1717">28:37</a> 恋爱脑如小怪癖，冷暖自知</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1784">29:44</a> 爱情不是必需品</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> kk的恋爱脑防控小技巧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1984">33:04</a> 拒绝画饼，明确需求</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2261">37:41</a> 他喜欢我，是因为我是我</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2432">40:32</a> 情侣心理咨询</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>BGM: Stephanie Poetri - Do You Love Me</span></p>]]></description>
