  <item>
    <title>015 聊聊新疆：千里万里是故乡</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65a1369e926ad7aad0db95a3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65a1369e926ad7aad0db95a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 Jan 2024 12:54:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期来听听土生土长的新疆人聊聊眼里的家乡！</span></p><span></span><p><span>💃🏻也许你知道大盘鸡，手抓饭，烤包子；知道这里有草原，沙漠，雪山；知道这里几乎有中国所有的少数民族、多种语言共存</span></p><span></span><p><span>👀我们带你看看普通新疆儿娃子&amp;丫头子眼里的家乡~</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️如果你去过新疆，或对新疆有疑惑和好奇，欢迎在评论区留言告诉我们，我们将认真回复我们知道的一切~</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 ｜ kk 盆仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾 ｜赛买提 买买提</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Highlights】</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 三个词概括我们眼里的新疆！</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>kk：好吃&amp;好玩 VS diversity&amp;hospitality</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>盆仔：多元&amp;巨大&amp;停滞</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>买买提：碳水炸弹&amp;高架上看雪山&amp;学语言</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>赛买提：颜值巅峰</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a> 无法割舍的新疆美食心头爱</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>盆仔：过油肉拌面</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>买买提：缸子肉（见shownotes末尾mention）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>赛买提：烤包子（同见shownotes末尾mention）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>kk：面肺子&amp;米肠子</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 新疆最出名的美食是炒米粉？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a> 我在七夕的新疆见过最美的星空</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1672">27:52</a> 过条马路就会跨入另一个世界</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1849">30:49</a> 不能喝的做小孩那桌，滑雪做轮胎的也是</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2289">38:09</a> 被牛羊群拦过路，才算是真的到过新疆</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>聊聊我们遇到过的刻板印象</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2363">39:23</a> 新疆人=少数民族？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 新疆人考大学超容易？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2463">41:03</a> 新疆人都会说“新疆话”？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2557">42:37</a> 新疆人不爱学习？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2606">43:26</a> 高考到底考骑马还是射箭？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2739">45:39</a> 关于时差：10点的日落，一点半的午休，11点的晚自习</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2815">46:55</a> 关于节日：一年过三次年是基操</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2968">49:28</a> 当我们思念家乡时，我们思念的是什么？</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>kk：无法触及又渐行渐远的家乡</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>赛买提：家乡是，我大概还能见我妈20次</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>买买提：最怀念的是随时随地和朋友闲逛聊天</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【Mentioned】</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然并未完全提及，但如果想更多的了解新疆的点滴，大家可以观看</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>关于美景</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>vlog博主 </span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/91236407/search/video?keyword=新疆" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/91236407/search/video?keyword=新疆"><span>jyhachi</span></a><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UP4y1s7Zw/?spm_id_from=333.788.recommend_more_video.-1&amp;vd_source=b8c0ff971621462290b17dba9c20e71b" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UP4y1s7Zw/?spm_id_from=333.788.recommend_more_video.-1&amp;vd_source=b8c0ff971621462290b17dba9c20e71b"><span>有结论了！最好的散步地点是赛里木湖边</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jM411B7YN/?spm_id_from=333.788.recommend_more_video.-1&amp;vd_source=b8c0ff971621462290b17dba9c20e71b" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jM411B7YN/?spm_id_from=333.788.recommend_more_video.-1&amp;vd_source=b8c0ff971621462290b17dba9c20e71b"><span>大过年的跟我去赛里木湖面上躺着！</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>关于美食</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/99157282?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/99157282?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>盗月社食遇记</span></a><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Lg411V762/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=b8c0ff971621462290b17dba9c20e71b" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Lg411V762/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=b8c0ff971621462290b17dba9c20e71b"><span>30元一缸！掀开盖子才明白，它为什么能称霸新疆街头｜缸子肉(｡ì _ í｡)</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Nb4y1S7jc/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=b8c0ff971621462290b17dba9c20e71b" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Nb4y1S7jc/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=b8c0ff971621462290b17dba9c20e71b"><span>新疆烤包子：2块5一个，一口爆汁！千万不能咬着吃！</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>关于风土人情</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/99157282?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/99157282?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>盗月社食遇记</span></a><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1b94y187VN/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=b8c0ff971621462290b17dba9c20e71b" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1b94y187VN/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=b8c0ff971621462290b17dba9c20e71b"><span>当我相信了新疆人的“简单吃一点”…</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uv411A7EJ/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=b8c0ff971621462290b17dba9c20e71b" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uv411A7EJ/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=b8c0ff971621462290b17dba9c20e71b"><span>真·社交牛逼症！在新疆，跟陌生阿姨回家吃饭，还切磋了舞蹈💃</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【播客小红书】@Loading加载中</span></p><span></span><p><span>【播客邮箱】loading0991@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: 艾热 AIR - 千里万里</span></p>]]></description>
